## Hints

- P1: the paired design's first line is the design itself — SDs,
  corr, n. sd(diff) = sqrt(sA²+sB²−2ρsAsB).
- P2: the spread (a) vs (c) measures the clustering the naive
  resampler broke; n_eff from 1+2Σρ̂(|r|).
- P5: the non-overlapping sample takes every 21st overlapping
  observation: N/21 observations, same mean/SD per observation.
- P6: quarterly, non-overlapping → no overlap flag; the family of 9
  is the paper's own; the gate is 4 events/yr at 12bp.
